right, um, were compromised, but that would

00:18:56.760 --> 00:19:01.689
not reveal the user's password, OK, and also it does

00:19:01.689 --> 00:19:06.040
not have much extra overhead for storage because the

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:11.010
storage, um, when you store a password or when you store password hash and then the

